+	bool "'cc_governor' cpufreq policy governor (SAGA)"
+	depends on CPU_FREQ && SMP
+	select CPU_FREQ_GOV_ATTR_SET
+	select IRQ_WORK
+	help
+	  "Cerebral Clutch Governor" -- a conservatively-tuned descendant of
+	  PCCG, rebalanced toward efficiency after real-world reports of
+	  PCCG pinning small cores near their ceiling most of the time.
+	  Headroom-correct target calculation, a busy%-gated floor that
+	  snaps back toward idle once the CPU genuinely goes quiet, a
+	  kthread filter on wake-edges, a recalibrated streak detector, and
+	  built-in sysfs telemetry (stat_triggers_total and friends) for
+	  further calibration against real device data. Self-sufficient;
+	  takes BORE and bore-warp as optional, independent enhancements
+	  when present. Tunable per policy via sysfs — safe to enable
